        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">material point displacement</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">Material Point Displacement in the context of the Material Point Method (MPM) refers to the movement of material points, which are used to track physical information like mass and velocity.</mathmoddb:P1459>
