        <mathmoddb:P104 rdf:resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fokker%E2%80%93Planck_equation"/>
        <mathmoddb:P12 xml:lang="en">Q891766</mathmoddb:P12>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">For vanishing drift and for constant diffusion, the Fokker Planck equation yield&apos;s Fick&apos;s first law of diffusion.</mathmoddb:P1459>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">Note the external forcing which connects the FPE to the model order reduction and/or optimal control tasks.</mathmoddb:P1459>
