        <mathmoddb:P12 xml:lang="en">Q1201087</mathmoddb:P12>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">The principle of detailed balance can be used in kinetic systems which are decomposed into elementary processes (collisions, or steps, or elementary reactions).</mathmoddb:P1459>
