        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">uniform gravitational acceleration</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">This is a very good approximation for an apple falling from a tree, but not for celestial mechanics where the inverse-square law of the gravitational field must be taken into account.</mathmoddb:P1459>
