tchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;munderover&gt;&lt;mo movablelimits=&quot;false&quot; stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;∑&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;m&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot; lspace=&quot;0&quot; rspace=&quot;0&quot;&gt;′&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;1&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;M&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/munderover&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;n&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;m&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot; lspace=&quot;0&quot; rspace=&quot;0&quot;&gt;′&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;mo&gt;,&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;l&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;t&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mfrac&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;mo data-mjx-texclass=&quot;CLOSE&quot;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mstyle&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;</mathmoddb:P989>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">rate of switching influencers formulation</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">Each individual i can at any time t switch its current influencer l′ to another influencer l with a given rate. By setting the pair function to ψ(x) = exp(−x), an individual has an exponentially higher rate to switch to an influencer that has a similar opinion than to an influencer with a very different opinion. This rate of switching influencers is defined by this formulation.</mathmoddb:P1459>
        <mathmoddb:P1460 rdf:resource="https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696"/>
        <mathmoddb:P1495 rdf:resource="https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265"/>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">rate of switching influencers</schema:description>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
