        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">solar system equations of motion</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">The acceleration of a celestial body can be calculated from Newton&apos;s Law of Gravitation. Each body attracts each other body, the total acceleration being the sum of all these attractions.</mathmoddb:P1459>
