        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Gamma-Gompertz-Makeham model</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">We assume that death counts at age x are Poisson-distributed and the underlying population level hazard function follows a Gamma-Gompertz-Makeham model.</mathmoddb:P1459>
