        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">quantum-classical potential</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">In quantum-classical molecular dynamics, this potential would contain all the (repulsive and attractive) Coulombic interactions between electrons and nuclei</mathmoddb:P1459>
