        <mathmoddb:P989 xml:lang="en">&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot; class=&quot;mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mstyle displaystyle=&quot;true&quot; scriptlevel=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;mtable displaystyle=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;mtr&gt;&lt;mtd class=&quot;mwe-math-columnalign-r&quot;&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;∅&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;→&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mtd&gt;&lt;/mtr&gt;&lt;mtr&gt;&lt;mtd class=&quot;mwe-math-columnalign-r&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;→&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;B&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;→&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi mathvariant=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;∅&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mtd&gt;&lt;/mtr&gt;&lt;/mtable&gt;&lt;/mstyle&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;</mathmoddb:P989>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">reaction diffusion system</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">∅ is interpreted as sources and sinks of molecules. The reaction producing A is locally restricted. A is converted to B at a rate of k₂.</mathmoddb:P1459>
