        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">plate with a hole: geometry</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">For use in a practical simulation, we consider a finite size square-shaped subdomain of the infinite plate around the hole. The computational effort is further reduced by only simulating one quarter of the domain and assuming symmetry conditions at the edges.</mathmoddb:P1459>
