        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">plane stress condition</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">When that situation occurs over an entire element of a structure, as is often the case for thin plates, the stress analysis is considerably simplified, as the stress state can be represented by a tensor of dimension 2</mathmoddb:P1459>
