        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">evaluation of biokinetic parameters</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">This task performs nonlinear parameter estimation using experimental data for biomass concentration and substrate concentration in a bioreactor. The objective is to determine key kinetic parameters, including the maximum specific growth rate, Monod constant, inhibition constant, and death rate coefficient, by fitting a dynamic model of biomass growth and substrate consumption to the observed data.</mathmoddb:P1459>
