        <mathmoddb:P983 xml:lang="en">&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot; class=&quot;mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mstyle displaystyle=&quot;true&quot; scriptlevel=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;Δ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;L&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mstyle&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;</mathmoddb:P983>
        <mathmoddb:P989 xml:lang="en">&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot; class=&quot;mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mstyle displaystyle=&quot;true&quot; scriptlevel=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;Δ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;L&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;Δ&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;H&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;U&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;F&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;⋅&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;L&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;m&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;1&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;−&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;e&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mn&gt;5&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;L&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;−&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;1&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;−&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;L&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;A&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;m&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;msqrt&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;R&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;E&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;G&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msqrt&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mstyle&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;</mathmoddb:P989>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">potential leaf area development equation</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">This equation computes the daily change in leaf area index during the active canopy development phase of crop growth. It applies from crop emergence until the onset of leaf decline and determines the rate at which leaf area expands. The formulation links leaf area development to phenological progress through the heat unit factor while limiting growth as the canopy approaches a crop-specific maximum leaf area index. Crop stress effects are incorporated through a regulating factor that reduces leaf expansion under unfavorable conditions. The equation ensures gradual and biologically realistic canopy expansion prior to senescence.</mathmoddb:P1459>
        <mathmoddb:P1460 rdf:resource="https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696"/>
        <mathmoddb:P1495 rdf:resource="https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265"/>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">computes daily increase in leaf area index</schema:description>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
