        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">mathematical pendulum period (small angle)</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">This relation is also known as Christiaan Huygens&apos;s law for the period of a pendulum. Note that under the small-angle approximation, the period is independent of the initial amplitude; this is the property of isochronism that Galileo first discovered.</mathmoddb:P1459>
