        <mathmoddb:P989 xml:lang="en">&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot; class=&quot;mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mstyle displaystyle=&quot;true&quot; scriptlevel=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;c&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;N&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;B&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;,&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;n&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mn&gt;1&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;+&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;n&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mn&gt;2&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;e&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;−&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;n&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mn&gt;3&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;H&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;U&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow data-mjx-texclass=&quot;ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;/mstyle&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;</mathmoddb:P989>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">optimal plant nitrogen concentration equation</rdfs:label>
        <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">This equation describes the decline of optimal plant nitrogen concentration with crop development stage. The concentration is modeled as a nonlinear function of the heat unit index using crop-specific parameters. It reflects the physiological tendency of plants to have high nitrogen concentrations during early growth and lower concentrations near maturity. The formulation provides a smooth, development-dependent target nitrogen concentration for demand estimation.</mathmoddb:P1459>
        <mathmoddb:P1460 rdf:resource="https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696"/>
        <mathmoddb:P1495 rdf:resource="https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265"/>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">estimates ideal crop nitrogen concentration as function of development</schema:description>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
